.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# Draft checkpoints: 1.2 GB each, 5.4 GB total. Transfer out of band and
# verify by md5 — a bridge measurement against a different checkpoint is a
# measurement of the wrong thing.
data/*.pt

# Quarantined partial shard: 70 records of an aborted collect, no value.
# The README beside it explains the class; the data itself need not travel.
data/_invalidated/*.jsonl

# Internal strategy/positioning notes: competitive framing, what we consider
# indefensible in our own work, and anticipated-review reasoning. Not needed to
# reproduce anything, and a process leak in a public anonymous release.
docs/novelty-verdict-*.md

# The 1000-record shard is 17 MB of HotpotQA prose. It trips the anonymity
# checker on benchmark text (accented proper nouns such as "Wom\xc3\xa9", phrases
# like "co-written by"), which are false positives but make the gate useless if
# left to fail every run. It is regenerable from 01_generate_trajectories.py +
# data/hotpot_split.json, and being batch-collected it is not byte-reproducible
# anyway. Its md5 and provenance are in docs/scaleup-result-2026-08-29.md.
data/shard_1p7b_scale.jsonl

# 1.2 GB draft checkpoints.
data/ckpt_base_chat_scale2.pt
